1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,040
Narrator: Listen to a librarian talking to a group of students.

2
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:06,250
Librarian: Hello, I'm the librarian.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:09,190
We use an electronic control system here,

4
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:15,070
which means you need to register on the computer before you borrow any books.

5
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:21,200
So please do remember to bring your ID card here whenever you want to borrow some books.

6
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:24,391
Besides, we accept online reservation on books

7
00:00:24,391 --> 00:00:32,140
so you could simply reserve the book you need wherever you have access to our school website.

8
00:00:32,140 --> 00:00:38,050
If you have any question, find me at work hours at the front desk.
